00:58:31.200 --> 00:58:37.510
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who explains how he hooked up with his best friend Urkel.

00:58:37.510 --> 00:58:44.320
<v Ron Mallett>I wasn't in that income group where I would have been able to run with the white nerds.

00:58:44.320 --> 00:58:55.680
